OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to pilot Hugh's Law after
OL,4,Adeath of boy, 6
OL,5,
OL,6,FCeri Menai-Davis told BBC Look East he
OL,7,Fhoped it would lead to measures to
OL,8,Fsupport families.
